  "key_sentences": [
    "September closed with one lost-time injury, in the processing plant.",
    "Ore mined reached 186,400 tonnes, 3% above plan.",
    "Copper in concentrate totalled 2,187 tonnes against a plan of 2,267 tonnes.",
    "The processing plant has exceeded its annual target for lost-time injuries, and a recovery plan is described in section 3.",
    "The investigation found that the overhead hoist had been out of service for two weeks without a replacement plan.",
    "Recovery returned to 90.4% in the last week of the month once the flotation cell was back in service.",
    "The dust reading at the tailings facility rose after strong winds on 22 and 23 September.",
    "The committee accepted the corrective actions and asked for a progress update in November."
  ],
